    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, 17F-03 went offline ten minutes ago. The corridor terminal can
      read the household file, but the unit will not accept a remote restart.
    holdSeconds: 10.206603
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6531515929adf0f47be79f262c0813f9, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_CorridorTerminal_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Mark and Laura installed a Family Coordination unit to support communication
      with their fourteen-year-old daughter, Ava. It handles conflict mediation,
      companionship, and guardian updates.
    holdSeconds: 10.206603
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5bd167fc9a94e346818e864ad5b2e6a, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: 17F03_CorridorTerminal_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The failure requires on-site repair. Use the terminal to authorize emergency
      entry, then inspect the unit inside.
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 07af3936cf1bd44439184bb681c1a101, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
